WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.950
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:05.180
You're Smiling!
A "Shutter-Chance" at the Beach.

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.830
No doubt about it...
Had I not heard what Dad said...

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.600
...it wouldn't have ended up so complicated.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.100
Oh?

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.850
I'm home!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.560
Do we have guests...?

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.840
Oh! Welcome home.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:53.470
Could you wait a bit?
I'll be done in a minute.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.140
Hmm! That's nice!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.240
Okay, everyone! Nice work!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:16.410
I'll contact your agency later
about my decision.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:18.490
You may get changed
in that room over there.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.440
Thank you for everything.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.460
Sure!
Thank you for everything.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.480
Wh...What do we have here?!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.070
Well... I received an urgent request, one I couldn't refuse.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:38.790
You see... the original photographer shacked up with one of the models.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.190
W...With a model...?!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.030
Well, this kind of a thing happens...
W...With a model...?!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:42.050
W...With a model...?!

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.960
...all too often in the modeling business.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:48.260
The sponsor, wanting to avoid a scandal, insisted on changing photographers.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.800
But you're a landscape photographer.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.140
Well, they've done some favors for me in the past, so...

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.260
Oh, I'll get it.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:00.950
Yes? This is the Kasuga residence.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:02.950
Oh, hello!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.420
Yes, we just finished, as a matter of fact.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:05.920
Sensei... The Polaroid proofs.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.910
Huh? Oh...
Sensei... The Polaroid proofs.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:07.980
Sensei... The Polaroid proofs.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.610
Well... yes, there is a girl
that I think would be good... Yes...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.970
I have your permission to make the decision myself, right?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:19.140
Yes... Yes...

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.260
Uh-huh...

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.060
P...Professional models, like they say...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:30.350
...are, well, undoubtedly sensational!

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:34.120
Besides... that spectacular sight seared itself into my eyes...

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.350
...and isn't about to leave my mind.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:42.940
Being beautiful... must be a talent in itself!

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:47.920
Hey, all! This here is all my "Award Winning" stuff!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:55.490
The perfect compositions
of Hatta once again prevail!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.200
But, man, it's amazing how you managed to shoot all of these!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.570
This chick is Nagai, from 2-C, right?

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.640
This one is Nakamura, from 1-A!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.540
You mean, "Miss Freshman?!"

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.140
Th...This is mine! This is mine!
Oh, man! Damn! Damn it, man!

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:07.480
That's gross! Don't drool on me!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.880
This is mine, man! Gimme it!
That's gross! Don't drool on me!

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.520
As usual, Ayukawa seemed
so unfriendly around the others.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.320
That smile of hers...

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.390
...somehow seemed like a lie to me.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.960
Yo, why are you just sitting there?!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.850
Hatta says he's ready to show the ultimate!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:59.590
Folks, you've been waiting for it!
The Sr. High Madonna's Panty Shots!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.130
Wh...What the hell is this?!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.640
Why, you! You quack!

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.640
Let's go!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.240
How can you keep a straight face?

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.400
Like this!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.370
If these guys ever go after my baby sisters...
It'd be a nightmare!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.980
Oh, I almost forgot!
Kasuga, next time we...

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.280
No you can't! I won't let you
photograph my sisters, no matter what!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.070
Come with me for a second!

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:42.830
M... Me?

00:06:55.920 --> 00:07:00.730
H...He's gonna kill me...
But if I use the Power to disappear, then...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.380
S...Still, what the heck
is he so steamed about?

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:19.180
I... I beg you! Please!

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:21.280
I, Hino Yuusaku, am bowing before you!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.880
H...Hey! What's wrong?!

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.520
D...Don't let Hikaru go into show business!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.590
What?!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:32.290
Sign: "Keep off the Flowers"

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:35.660
Yup, yup! Would you jump over here,
like "Hop! Whee?!"
Sign: "Keep off the Flowers"

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.990
Here?

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.620
Yeah! "Fickle-Minded Angel
Humming Amidst the Flowers!"

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.360
That's the title. Right?

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.670
What ARE you talking about?

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.740
Wow! All right!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.040
Manami, let's do it!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.030
S...Sure...
Manami, let's do it!

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.470
Ready, Set...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:53.980
Go!

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.540
Now!
Go!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.540
I guess we've messed up!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.830
P...Please don't laugh...

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:10.060
Hikaru was... She personally told me what I just told you.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.430
But, you know...

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:15.270
Hikaru tends to set her heart on
something new altogether too often.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.390
That's very true!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.240
Want me to break a few of your teeth, so you can't ever laugh again?!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:27.400
Oh, no! That's quite all right!

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:31.580
Still, if what you've said is true, then I do have concerns! Yes!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:36.280
But, she didn't tell me anything about going to an audition.

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:40.010
No! It wasn't an audition
or anything like that, Madoka!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.370
"What? A concert?!"

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.870
"Y... Yeah... Well? Isn't this
the band that you like, Hikaru?"

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.500
"It's next Sunday..."

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.150
"Bzzt! You win a 'That's Too Bad' Award!"

00:08:57.150 --> 00:09:01.510
"It's really too bad,
but next Sunday I'll be... working!"

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.150
"W... Working?!"

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.410
"Yup!"

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:08.680
"'Cause, I've been discovered by a photographer!"

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:13.020
"D...Discovered?!"

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.770
Right? You know what I mean?

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:19.560
The truth is, I don't
wanna ask you this, but...

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.100
"Sacrifice for what is important," as the saying goes.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:27.530
Huh? Oh! Hmm... A model, eh?

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:31.750
"You see... the original photographer shacked up with one of the models."

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.710
"Well, this kind of a thing happens all too often..."

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.140
It can't be!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:43.090
"See? So I'm saying, y'know, right now, when you're shining the brightest."

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:48.320
"That's how I'd like to capture you, you see... as a 'newborn star'..."

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:54.260
"Huh? Oh, no! I can't
possibly be that! Or can I?"

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:58.740
Y...You're right! From what I hear, sleazy stuff happens sometimes!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.370
Right? Don't you feel the same way?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.230
My goodness! What are you guys
so excited about?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:07.940
Huh? Oh! Well... er...

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.410
Aha! I found you!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.350
H... Hikaru!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.780
I looked everywhere for you, Darling!

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:19.950
I had no idea that you'd be with Madoka!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:26.200
We were just about to make plans on how we could prevent...

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.200
...our adorable Hikaru from
getting mixed up in something crazy.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:30.930
Oh! No! You know about it already?!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.170
This guy told you, didn't he?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:33.800
"Th... This guy?!"
This guy told you, didn't he?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.530
This is awful! Awful!
"Th... This guy?!"

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:35.610
This is awful! Awful!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:40.380
I wanted you... Madoka and Darling... to be the first to know about it!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:43.150
So... So it's all true!
What we heard, that is?

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:46.020
Haha! See, it all happened yesterday.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.590
I was window-shopping
on Main Street, see...

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:52.380
And, then, this cameraman said, "Oh, I've never seen..."

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.270
Hikaru's story began to...

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:58.200
...get more and more exaggerated.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.200
But, still...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:12.810
The same Hikaru that's...
usually quite bothersome...

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:17.120
...it somehow felt like she might really become an idol star.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.580
That's what it seemed like to me.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.100
Hikaru!

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:48.750
"Don't worry!"

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.180
"I'll keep her company at the photo-shoot."

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.050
"YOU will?!"

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.070
"Yup."
"YOU will?!"

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:54.150
"YOU will?!"

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.650
"'Cause you seem awfully worried... y'know!"

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.580
"Huh? Th... That's not necessarily..."

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.900
What?! Today?! But, today is Sunday!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.670
Huh? Uh-huh...

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.910
Well... I'm sure that you have plans...

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.450
...and I'm sorry to have
to ask at the last minute.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:43.450
The problem is that the model
has a scheduling problem, see...

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.070
...so, it really has to be done today!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:51.580
Oh, gosh... If I had nothing planned, I'd help you out, but I'm busy today.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:56.750
I need to go to ABCB to fill in for Ayukawa.

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:58.700
Oh, I see...

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:03.720
Well, Kurumi and Manami can help out a bit,
but I need some "manpower."

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.770
Oh? I've already made
arrangements for that.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:07.570
What?               Who did you ask?

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.500
What?               Who did you ask?

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:09.830
Komatsu and Hatta.
What?               Who did you ask?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.930
WHAT?!
Komatsu and Hatta.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:14.210
Well! Komatsu said something to me once...

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:17.870
Like, "I wish I had a chance to learn about cameras from your Daddy!"

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.120
Lies! Lies! Lies! That's just an excuse!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.120
There's no way that those two would...

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.770
Kasuga!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.920
See? They're here!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:31.820
Oh man...

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:32.460
Oh man... Huh?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.830
Dammit... Those bozos!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.880
Since when are they so interested in learning about cameras?!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.290
Howdy!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:47.200
I'm tellin' ya, Kasuga... Really, don't mind us!
You should take it easy.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.350
You've got to work today, right?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:57.510
Count on us 100%,
as far as your sisters are concerned!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.590
100%, eh? How could I?
And what the heck is that?!

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:11.000
Huh? What? What the?! Oh, my!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.430
Oh? Oh! Oh! Er... Well...
Huh? What? What the?! Oh, my!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:14.500
Huh? What? What the?! Oh, my!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.430
Oh, my, what do we have here?! This is odd, truly odd!

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.340
Uh-huh!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:18.560
Why, you... Gimme that!
Uh-huh!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:20.260
Whoa! Stop! The shutter-cable...!
Why, you... Gimme that!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.150
Oh, hi there! Over here!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:31.080
Oh! Here we go, Kasuga! The model is here!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.990
Oh! Oh, my! What's up, Sempai?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.420
D...Does this mean that...
the one who discovered Hikaru is...

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.630
Oh, gee! Is she someone you know, Kyosuke?

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:49.930
Oh! Hikaru! She's in
the homeroom next to ours!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.450
Yippee! Lucky, lucky me! This means that...

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:58.870
...Kyosuke's father approves of me!

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.480
I hope that we can
work well together, "Father!"

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:05.640
Oh! Why, same here!

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:14.100
In the end, better than
any model he auditioned...

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.730
...the Hikaru that Dad noticed walking around town...

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:21.250
...had the fresh image
that he wanted, it seemed.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:46.690
But... somehow...
my relationship with Ayukawa...

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:50.130
...at a time like this... feels awkward.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.600
Oh! Look, the sea!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.150
Huh?
Oh! Look, the sea!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:06.880
Yahoo!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.510
Yahoo!
Yahoo!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:10.980
Go for it!

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:11.850
I'll get you!
Go for it!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.350
Why don't you put THEM to work?

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:27.040
Huh? Oh, well, let them be.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.540
Actually, once we start shooting, the fewer people, the better.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.400
Let me see now... Can we get started?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.910
Sure!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.340
Kyosuke, shall we get going?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.360
Uh-huh...
Kyosuke, shall we get going?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.210
Hold it right there!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:44.670
I hope they'll be all right...
Kurumi and Manami, that is.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.860
To be honest, I never expected...

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:23.050
...that Hikaru would look THIS cute!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.060
Oh! I won't let you get away!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.100
Manami! Over there! Over there!

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:38.470
My! He's quick!
Manami! Over there! Over there!

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:42.240
Th... This time for sure,
it's the perfect chance, Hatta!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.470
No kidding!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.680
Why, you!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.610
Oh!
Why, you!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:47.680
Why, you!

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.510
Manami, stick your hand in!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:49.740
Yup!
Manami, stick your hand in!

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.720
Hatta! NOW!
Yup!

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.590
Oh! The camera!
Oh! The camera!

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.590
No...!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.060
Look what happened to it! No!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.120
I hate you, Sea!
Look what happened to it! No!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.660
What? You're going back, Madoka?

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:17.220
Yeah. I know now that
there's nothing to worry about.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:21.610
Besides, by now Master will probably be terribly short-handed, so...

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.410
A... Ayukawa...

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.080
See ya!
A... Ayukawa...

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.690
W... Wait a second!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.450
Oh, please excuse me.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:30.580
No problem.
Oh, please excuse me.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.620
H... Hey!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:49.030
I... I can't find the words... to make Ayukawa stop!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.610
Er... Kyosuke?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.670
Huh?
Er... Kyosuke?

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:58.880
Well... I was hoping that she'd
work for me too. As a model, that is.

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.790
What?!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.550
Well? Could you ask her for me?
What?!

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:03.620
What?!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.690
Dad!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.510
What? He wants ME to model?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.970
Yeah! Will you?
What? He wants ME to model?

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:24.040
Be serious! That's not me.
Yeah! Will you?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.850
Be serious! That's not me.

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.940
Oh! Wait, will you!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:34.040
I think you should go back. Aren't you supposed to be helping your father?

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:43.920
Ayukawa... Don't go... Don't go!

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.430
Then... I'll go with you!

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.260
What?
Then... I'll go with you!

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:56.610
If you model for us, I'm sure that we'd get some great shots!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:20:00.240
If... If that's not possible though, then...
it's no use staying!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.980
What are you talking about? Hikaru is modeling for you!

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.260
Hikaru has nothing to do with this!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:09.690
As far as I'm concerned, if you can't model,
I won't be able to stand it!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:22.010
I am so unfair! Earlier, I was
thinking about how cute Hikaru was.

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:24.030
But, I still want Ayukawa to...

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:37.540
You're like a grumpy little kid, Kasuga!

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:49.530
Gosh... What a troublemaker you are!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:52.690
Ayukawa!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.670
Madoka! Break a leg!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:12.150
Ayukawa...

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:52.460
Wow...

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:55.500
Well? What do you think about my first portrait project?

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:58.690
It's obvious you're a pro!

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:02.320
Although, I must say...
She really surprised me.

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:08.080
Her expressions. They change as fast as the eyes of a cat!

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:12.510
I was very lucky to discover both her and Hikaru.

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:22.610
Ayukawa...

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.120
The pictures? They're ready?

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:32.450
Of course! For what it's worth, my dad is a pro, you know.

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:38.040
Oh, here. He said it's
pretty good for a snapshot, so...

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.760
Here you go!

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:45.240
Oh, sure! It's pretty good! It's the best!

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.010
Oh! What the...?!

00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:52.250
It...It's a mistake!
This is the wrong picture!

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:54.540
Er... It's this one!

00:23:14.510 --> 00:23:16.630
"Ayukawa"

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:26.340
I, Kasuga Kyosuke,
have once again... totally goo...

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:30.050
What a goofball! Really...

00:23:54.880 --> 00:24:02.490
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:10.070
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:25.420
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.420 --> 00:24:38.030
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.030 --> 00:24:48.240
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.240 --> 00:24:55.250
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.250 --> 00:25:06.650
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:13.190 --> 00:25:16.700
Don't panic just because Kurumi got kidnapped!

00:25:16.700 --> 00:25:20.720
If something happens, she'll use the Power...
and the crook will be TKO!

00:25:21.100 --> 00:25:23.870
What?! She's used it all up?!

00:25:23.870 --> 00:25:26.140
Now, that's a problem!

00:25:26.140 --> 00:25:30.180
Next time: "Kurumi,
I'll Teach You How To Date."

00:25:30.180 --> 00:25:33.300
I'm... worried!
